
$

PROJECT 'KARIMUN' '001'
SET 0 MAXERR 99  NAUTICAL  
&MODE NONSTationary TWODimensional
&COORDinates SPHE CCM

MODE NONSTATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
&SET DEPMIN 0.05 INRHOG 1 NAUTICAL PWTAIL 5
COORDINATES SPHERICAL


&& KEYWORD for number of nested SWAN grids.
NSGRIDS 2

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ COMPUTATIONAL GRID &&
CGRID CURVILINEAR 55 38 EXC 9.999000e+003 9.999000e+003 CIRCLE 24 0.04 1.0 28
READGRID COORDINATES 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan9km.grd' 3 0 0 FREE 

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ BATHYMETRY GRID &&
INPGRID BOTTOM CURVILINEAR 0 0 55 38 EXC 9.999000e+003
READINP BOTTOM 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan9km.bot' 3 0 FREE 

$******************** ERA5 Wind  *********************************************

&& KEYWORD TO CREATE WIND GRID &&
&INPGRID WIND REGULAR 100 -11 0 111 106 0.1 0.1 &
&NONSTATIONARY 20221229.000000 6 HR 20221230.000000
&READINP WIND 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan' 3 0 FREE

